  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "b4f97f53-17e6-499c-9dd5-128fd911e628",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e note o que já estava acontecendo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3514622d-3ff4-4af5-bcd9-9f2644a351b9",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Estaba trabajando en una cafetería y escuchaba música con los auriculares.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu estava trabalhando em uma cafeteria e escutava música com os fones.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4364198e341e4534b3fae7ed9dc1c77b_b03b01-cafe-background-scene-phase4.png?Expires=1794099686&Signature=GA2PhNTCWePBZN8iBVZsv14kiWl8XTWJdL5czfC60pzRgRrSUvHbilyoUKjpUQtSeh29~nkV4EI0MGuxewpQOb1Y8eeyF4WgFPdweHY0KWS4QmP620aZYpvde4EvNYrpHgpEajxo0GtCb4bNDkVbyEG43PO6Oes6AKO78UbZS1blk676rhgNtmUwrbaOe6BvBitnkhj1roCT~QqDxc2e4QYErxhy8oIAtCF83rcmTb-AEBryKEkiVQ3Rvne4KGudfz99MYtaVTKHbkg0-PyXQQhKRZitBNtsU75gAiwJVv5EWuHSa53IpuNbv4n~1fMhMwt598-VMq4ilOpm0MAWDA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b2cacc4bc49c42a4abd7a18219884cb1_b03b01-estaba-trabajando-en-una-cafeteria-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099686&Signature=qfB7W79OtoC-LNOKmEQwFnhpgRuwPZNNUpfCIAonwxhGV1nvxtYtdySx844dHwFRJC6anNLxo5ofMItfih2xvZ48OTtJPJvUA26C4EEFvAVDnW60A1AfQsVHy4Z6itaLhAmSI2pY5rLJ4mGPcJ0uxDZxQwtvkfTh6FoeurMUuY9GJmXptO4kultQvnIMyABqG57XQrZxIjFrkPwVzSMwU6O1TOhTM5SZDT73y7Yi~APtmNxwrBffH0YjojLEAmkcpWzWymMpFFDJtWqRIBEbeHlhwT6gdpNmUeWq5QKJnEoom9FKF9Y0aXsIJ8b8hl6-MHJVHGwscPff9jR8ujh~7w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
